        "items": [
          {
            "type": 12,
            "content": {
              "version": "NotebookGroup/1.0",
              "groupType": "editable",
              "items": [
                {
                  "type": 1,
                  "content": {
                    "json": "<div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin:2px 0 2px 0;\">\n  <span style=\"font-size:18px;line-height:1;\">🧩</span>\n  <h3 style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;color:#0f172a;letter-spacing:-0.2px;\">Per-partition capacity</h3>\n</div>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif;font-size:12.5px;color:#64748b;line-height:1.45;\">Free metrics. Throughput is split evenly across physical partitions &mdash; if one is at 100% and the rest are idle, adding RU/s will not help. <b>At scale:</b> this container has <b>{MPartCount}</b> physical partitions. The <b>grids</b> are ranked hottest-first and list up to <b>1,000</b>. The <b>line chart</b> is capped by Azure Monitor at <b>10 ranges</b> and does not guarantee the hottest is among them &mdash; read the ranked grid beneath it for the complete picture.</p>"
                  },
                  "name": "partition-metrics-card"
                },
                {
                  "type": 3,
                  "content": {
                    "version": "KqlItem/1.0",
                    "query": "{\"version\":\"ARMEndpoint/1.0\",\"data\":null,\"headers\":[],\"method\":\"GET\",\"path\":\"{CosmosAccount}/providers/microsoft.insights/metrics\",\"urlParams\":[{\"key\":\"api-version\",\"value\":\"2019-07-01\"},{\"key\":\"metricnames\",\"value\":\"NormalizedRUConsumption\"},{\"key\":\"aggregation\",\"value\":\"Maximum\"},{\"key\":\"interval\",\"value\":\"FULL\"},{\"key\":\"timespan\",\"value\":\"{TimeRange:startISO}/{TimeRange:endISO}\"},{\"key\":\"top\",\"value\":\"1000\"},{\"key\":\"orderby\",\"value\":\"maximum desc\"},{\"key\":\"$filter\",\"value\":\"DatabaseName eq '{DatabaseName}' and CollectionName eq '{Container}' and PhysicalPartitionId eq '*'\"}],\"batchDisabled\":false,\"transformers\":[{\"type\":\"jsonpath\",\"settings\":{\"tablePath\":\"$.value[0].timeseries\",\"columns\":[{\"path\":\"$.metadatavalues[2].value\",\"columnid\":\"PhysicalPartitionId\",\"columnType\":\"string\"},{\"path\":\"$.data[0].maximum\",\"columnid\":\"Peak RU %\",\"columnType\":\"real\"}]}}]}",
                    "size": 1,
                    "title": "🔥 Peak RU saturation per physical partition",
                    "noDataMessage": "No data for this scope and window. Platform metrics need no setup, so an empty result means the container genuinely received no traffic — try widening the time range.",
                    "noDataMessageStyle": 1,
                    "queryType": 12,
